# F3. Input. System.in on Wasm GC reads bytes from one host import, teavmConsole.getcharStdin()
# (0..255, -1 = end of input); the host decides the source (a buffer known up front today; a blocking
# interactive source later). IO.readln() / IO.readln(String) (JDK 25) and a java.util.Scanner subset
# (next, nextLine, nextInt, nextLong, nextDouble, nextBoolean, hasNext*, close; Scanner(InputStream),
# Scanner(String)) with JDK semantics. UTF-8 is decoded by hand (Utf8InputDecoder) because
# InputStreamReader's charset machinery does not build for Wasm GC in TeaVM 0.13.1.
#
# Applies to: github.com/konsoletyper/teavm tag 0.13.1 (b3a245b7)

